(function(root){
'use strict';
function mount(panel){
 const model=root.PLPassageModel.create(root.PLPassageSample),esc=root.MatchWorkspace.esc,node=id=>panel.querySelector('#pl-p-'+id),text=(n,s)=>{if(n.textContent!==s)n.textContent=s;};
 const ball=root.PLPassageBallModel&&root.PLPassageBallSample?root.PLPassageBallModel.create(root.PLPassageBallSample,root.PLPassageSample,root.PLPassageReceipt,root.PLPassageBallContinuitySample,root.PLPassageBallContinuityReceipt):null;
 const combined=root.PLPassageCombinedModel&&root.PLPassageCombinedSample?root.PLPassageCombinedModel.create(root.PLPassageCombinedSample,root.PLPassageCombinedReceipt,model,root.PLPassageBallContinuitySample):null;
 const native=combined||ball?.detail,trackLabel=id=>combined?combined.label(id):model.label(id),trackTag=id=>combined?combined.tag(id):model.tag(id);
 const format=t=>Math.floor(t/60)+':'+(t%60).toFixed(2).padStart(5,'0');
 let cursor=0,detailCursor=combined?0:null,selected=combined?.at(0).people[0]?.id||model.at(0).markers[0]?.id||null,active=false,timer=null,generation=0,membership='',bandsMode='';
 const current=()=>detailCursor===null?model.at(cursor):native.at(detailCursor),last=()=>detailCursor===null?336:native.count-1;
 const ballMethod=ball?'<p>The 5 Hz passage retains 49 reviewed video ball observations and 13 uncertain pitch estimates among 337 samples. At overlapping exact instants, the reviewed native estimate takes precedence. Other original observations remain unchanged.</p>'+(!combined&&ball.detail?'<p>Play ball sequence opens 55 exact native observations at 25 Hz over source 83:00.60–83:02.76 (2.16 seconds). People are hidden throughout this detail mode: their 5 Hz positions do not support native-frame playback. Back to passage pauses and explicitly snaps to the nearest 5 Hz sample. No positions are held or interpolated.</p><p>The native segment combines 54 reviewed bidirectional image tracks with current-frame ball-box lower-edge proxies and one separately reviewed manual lower-edge estimate at native frame 803 (M803-1), with broad ±4-pixel image uncertainty. A duplicate-box ambiguity remains rejected in the original fixed trial; the manual augmentation has separate provenance. Every imported native point uses its own qualified camera, not a reused 5 Hz transform.</p>':'')+'<p>Ball adjudication is retrospective and uses later supporting frames: nearby ±0.08-second context for the original observations, endpoint-seeded windows for native tracks and frames 801–805 for manual frame 803. This is not live or known-then knowledge. Apparent near-ground context supports estimates; height/contact, blur, camera and assumed field dimensions remain uncertain. Native-camera field overlays were inspected as chronological stills, not continuous video. Airborne/height-ambiguous balls stay screen-only. Source images/video are not embedded.</p>':'<p>Ball position is unknown throughout this person-only view.</p>';
 const questions=['Where is this track?','What is visible here?','Where is the ball?','Why is there a gap?','What supports this?'];
 panel.innerHTML=`<div class="goal-context"><div><span class="eyebrow">LONGER VIDEO PASSAGE</span><h2>${combined?'Players & ball':'On the pitch'}</h2><p>Brentford–Chelsea · Estimated positions · No live feed</p></div><details class="goal-sources"><summary>Sources & method ↗</summary><p>Existing official video, source 82:30.0–83:37.2. These are media times, not a verified football clock or exact goal time. No reported events, score or named lineup is imported into this view.</p><p>Football-specific camera calibration and generic person detection/tracking processed 1,681 consecutive native frames. This export samples every fifth frame: five samples per second. Human review covered 169 stills at 0.4-second spacing and 57 native diagnostics, not all frames. Computational success does not prove visual accuracy.</p><p>The full interval failed its quality gate because a reviewed camera gap lasted 0.88 seconds. Qualified sections are 82:30.0–83:31.6 and 83:32.6–83:37.2, with additional individual gaps shown on the timeline. Missing or unstable camera estimates clear all markers.</p><p>Markers project person-box bottom-centres onto an assumed 105 × 68 ground plane, shown as normalized percentages. Dimensions, feet and locations are uncertain; no metre accuracy, speed, distance, height or complete XI is supplied. Clipped feet, ambiguous overlaps and horizontal poses are withheld conservatively. Generic candidates may still include officials or duplicates.</p><p>Letters are anonymous selection labels, never shirt numbers. All automatic track associations are proposed; only Track B and Track C have reviewed continuations from video 83:30.0 onward. Missing detections and positions stay missing. No names, teams or roles are joined.</p><p>No positions are held or interpolated between samples. Playback advances the actual sampled source clock at 1×.</p>${ballMethod}${combined?'<p>The combined eight-second passage reviews 201 chronological native stills at 25 Hz. People and ball qualify independently at each exact frame; 104 ball pitch estimates, 81 screen-only and 16 unknown frames. The longest ball-estimate run is 2.16 seconds. Person clipping/overlap/pose exclusions remain; all anonymous associations are proposed and generic candidates can include officials. The added ball proxies use reviewed current-frame lower edges and exact native cameras; neither height/contact nor metric accuracy is measured. No held/interpolated positions, identities or event facts.</p>':''}<p><a href="${esc(model.source.url)}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Official full recording ↗</a> · Opens material beyond this passage.</p><details><summary>Source receipts</summary><pre tabindex="0">${esc(JSON.stringify(ball?{people:root.PLPassageReceipt,ball:root.PLPassageBallReceipt,nativeBall:root.PLPassageBallContinuityReceipt,combined:root.PLPassageCombinedReceipt}:root.PLPassageReceipt,null,2))}</pre><p>Models and source media are not bundled. License and source-use clearance for publication remain separate.</p></details></details></div>
 <div class="goal-layout passage-layout"><section class="goal-pitch-panel" aria-label="Longer passage replay"><div class="goal-pitch-meta"><strong>Full pitch · estimated ground plane</strong><span id="pl-p-clock"></span></div><div class="goal-pitch passage-pitch" id="pl-p-field" role="group" aria-label="Estimated full pitch. Left goal to right goal; far touchline above, near touchline below. Select a person candidate or use the roster."><svg viewBox="0 0 105 68" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M0 0H105V68H0Z M52.5 0V68 M0 13.84H16.5V54.16H0 M105 13.84H88.5V54.16H105 M0 24.84H5.5V43.16H0 M105 24.84H99.5V43.16H105 M16.5 26.69A9.15 9.15 0 0 1 16.5 41.31 M88.5 26.69A9.15 9.15 0 0 0 88.5 41.31"/><circle cx="52.5" cy="34" r="9.15"/></svg><div id="pl-p-markers"></div>${ball?'<span id="pl-p-ball" class="passage-ball" role="img" hidden></span>':''}<p id="pl-p-empty" class="goal-empty" hidden>Positions unknown<br><small>Camera support withheld at this sample</small></p></div><p class="goal-estimate-note">Estimated positions · Exact sampled source frames · Letters identify anonymous tracks${ball?' · Dashed ball ring = estimate':' · Ball unknown'}</p><p id="pl-p-mode" class="goal-readout passage-mode-note"></p>${ball?'<p class="goal-readout">'+(combined?'8 seconds · 25 Hz · People + independently supported ball':ball.detail?'Ball detail: 55 native frames · 2.16 seconds · 1 manual estimate':'49 reviewed video ball observations · 13 pitch estimates / 337 samples')+'</p>':''}<p id="pl-p-ball-status" class="goal-readout"></p><p id="pl-p-coverage" class="goal-readout"></p><p id="pl-p-selection" class="goal-readout"></p><div class="goal-transport"><label for="pl-p-range">Source video <strong id="pl-p-time"></strong></label><input id="pl-p-range" type="range" min="0" max="336" step="1" value="0"><div id="pl-p-bands" class="goal-bands passage-bands" aria-label="Source sample coverage; amber bands are camera gaps">${model.samples.map(s=>`<span class="${s.camera==='gap'?'gap':'action'}" title="${format(s.time)} · ${s.camera==='gap'?'Camera gap':'Estimated sample'}"></span>`).join('')}</div><div class="goal-controls"><button id="pl-p-play" aria-pressed="false">▶ Play 1×</button><button id="pl-p-start">← Start</button><button id="pl-p-previous">← Previous sample</button><button id="pl-p-next">Next sample →</button><button id="pl-p-end">End →</button><button id="pl-p-gap">Inspect next gap</button>${ball?'<button id="pl-p-next-ball">Next ball estimate →</button>'+(native?'<button id="pl-p-ball-detail">'+(combined?'▶ Players & ball · 8-second passage':'▶ Play ball sequence · 25 Hz')+'</button><button id="pl-p-back-passage" hidden>← Back to passage · 5 Hz</button>':''):''}</div><p id="pl-p-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p></div></section>
 <section class="goal-roster passage-roster" aria-label="Person candidates at this sample"><div><h3>People in view</h3><span id="pl-p-roster-clock"></span></div><p>Visible anonymous candidates and your selected track. Team and role unknown; officials may be included.</p><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Track</th><th scope="col">At this sample</th></tr></thead><tbody id="pl-p-roster"></tbody></table><p>Automatic associations are proposed. Track B/C continuations are reviewed only from source 83:30.0 onward.</p></section></div>
 <section class="goal-conversation conversation passage-conversation" aria-label="Questions about this sampled moment"><div class="conversation-bar"><div><span class="avatar" aria-hidden="true">↗</span><div><strong>This sampled moment</strong><small>Cursor and selected track · Local answers · No AI</small></div></div></div><div id="pl-p-thread" role="log" aria-live="polite"></div><div class="goal-suggestions">${questions.map(q=>`<button data-passage-question="${esc(q)}">${esc(q)}</button>`).join('')}</div><form id="pl-p-composer"><label class="sr-only" for="pl-p-draft">Question about this sampled moment</label><input id="pl-p-draft" placeholder="Ask about this sample or track…" autocomplete="off"><button type="submit" aria-label="Send question">↑</button></form><p id="pl-p-answer-status">Answers use only the current sample and selected track.</p></section>`;
 function clear(){node('thread').replaceChildren();text(node('answer-status'),'Answers use only the current sample and selected track.');}
 function stop(){const wasPlaying=timer!==null;generation++;if(timer!==null)clearInterval(timer);timer=null;text(node('play'),'▶ Play 1×');node('play').setAttribute('aria-pressed','false');if(wasPlaying)text(node('status'),'Paused at source '+format(current().time)+(detailCursor!==null?(combined?' · Combined native passage.':' · Ball detail; people hidden.'):'.'));}
 function paint(){
  const detail=detailCursor!==null,t=current().time,s=detail?(combined?{...current(),markers:current().people}:{time:t,markers:[],withheldCount:0}):model.at(cursor),v=detail?(combined?combined.view(t,selected):{gap:false,selected:null}):model.view(t,selected),ids=s.markers.map(m=>m.id);if(selected&&!ids.includes(selected))ids.push(selected);
  const key=(detail?'detail:':'passage:')+s.markers.map(m=>m.id).join('|')+';selected:'+(selected||'');
  if(key!==membership){
   const focused=document.activeElement,hadRoster=focused?.dataset?.passageTrack;membership=key;
   node('roster').innerHTML=ids.map(id=>`<tr id="pl-p-row-${id}"><th scope="row"><button data-passage-track="${id}" aria-pressed="false"><span class="goal-roster-tag passage-tag">${trackTag(id)}</span>${trackLabel(id)}</button></th><td id="pl-p-quality-${id}"></td></tr>`).join('');
   node('markers').innerHTML=s.markers.map(m=>`<button id="pl-p-marker-${m.id}" class="goal-marker passage-marker" data-passage-track="${m.id}" aria-pressed="false"><span>${trackTag(m.id)}</span></button>`).join('');
   if(hadRoster)node('roster').querySelector(`[data-passage-track="${selected}"]`)?.focus({preventScroll:true});
  }
  for(const id of ids){const m=s.markers.find(p=>p.id===id),row=node('row-'+id),b=row.querySelector('button');row.classList.toggle('selected',id===selected);b.setAttribute('aria-pressed',String(id===selected));text(node('quality-'+id),detail&&!combined?'Hidden in ball detail':m?(m.association==='reviewed-continuation'?'Estimated · reviewed link':'Estimated · proposed link'):'Position unknown');if(m){const marker=node('marker-'+id);marker.style.left=m.x+'%';marker.style.top=m.y+'%';marker.setAttribute('aria-pressed',String(id===selected));marker.setAttribute('aria-label',trackLabel(id)+'. Estimated person position; team and role unknown.');}}
  node('range').max=String(last());node('range').value=String(detail?detailCursor:cursor);text(node('time'),format(t));text(node('clock'),'Source '+format(t));text(node('roster-clock'),format(t));
  const bandsKey=detail&&combined?'combined':'passage';if(bandsKey!==bandsMode){bandsMode=bandsKey;node('bands').innerHTML=(detail&&combined?Array.from({length:201},(_,i)=>combined.at(i)):model.samples).map(f=>`<span class="${detail&&combined?(f.ball.state==='estimated'?'action':f.ball.state==='screen_only'?'screen':'unknown'):f.camera==='gap'?'gap':'action'}" title="Source ${format(f.time)} · ${detail&&combined?f.ball.state:f.camera}"></span>`).join('');node('bands').setAttribute('aria-label',detail&&combined?'Ball coverage: green uncertain pitch estimate, amber seen with pitch unknown, grey unknown. People have independent per-frame support.':'Source sample coverage; amber bands are camera gaps');}
  text(node('mode'),detail?(combined?'Players & ball · 8-second passage · 25 Hz':'25 Hz ball detail · People hidden'):'5 Hz passage · Exact source samples');
  text(node('coverage'),detail?(combined?s.markers.length+' current person estimates · '+s.withheldCount+' candidates withheld':'People hidden · Native ball frames have no matching 25 Hz person observations'):v.gap?'Camera gap · all positions withheld · no held or interpolated motion':s.markers.length+' person candidates placed · '+s.withheldCount+' uncertain candidates withheld · ball unknown');
  text(node('selection'),trackLabel(selected)+(detail&&!combined?' · person position hidden in ball detail':v.selected?' · estimated position at this sample · '+(v.selected.association==='reviewed-continuation'?'reviewed continuation':'proposed association'):' · position unknown at this sample'));
  let ballText='Ball unknown';
  if(ball){const b=detail&&combined?v.ball:ball.view(t),marker=node('ball');marker.hidden=b.state!=='estimated';marker.classList.toggle('manual',(b.observation?.method||b.method)==='manual_lower_edge_M803-1');if(b.pitch){marker.style.left=b.pitch.x+'%';marker.style.top=b.pitch.y+'%';marker.setAttribute('aria-label',(detail&&combined?combined.ballDescription(t):ball.describe(t))+' at source '+format(t)+'. Retrospective estimate; height and contact unmeasured.');}ballText=detail&&combined?combined.ballDescription(t):ball.describe(t);text(node('ball-status'),ballText);if(!detail)text(node('coverage'),v.gap?'Camera gap · all pitch positions withheld · no held or interpolated motion':s.markers.length+' person candidates placed · '+s.withheldCount+' uncertain candidates withheld');node('next-ball').hidden=detail&&!combined;if(native){node('ball-detail').hidden=detail;node('back-passage').hidden=!detail;}}
  node('range').setAttribute('aria-valuetext',`Source video ${format(t)}. ${detail?(combined?s.markers.length+' current person estimates; 25 Hz':'25 Hz ball detail; people hidden'):v.gap?'Camera gap':s.markers.length+' person candidates placed'}. ${ballText}.`);
  node('bands').hidden=detail&&!combined;node('gap').hidden=detail&&!combined;text(node('gap'),detail&&combined?'Inspect next ball gap':'Inspect next gap');node('empty').hidden=detail||!v.gap;node('previous').disabled=(detail?detailCursor:cursor)===0;node('next').disabled=(detail?detailCursor:cursor)===last();node('play').disabled=(detail?detailCursor:cursor)===last();
 }
 function seek(value){stop();if(detailCursor===null)cursor=model.index(value);else detailCursor=native.index(value);clear();paint();text(node('status'),'Paused at source '+format(current().time)+(detailCursor!==null?(combined?' · Combined native passage.':' · Ball detail; people hidden.'):model.view(current().time,selected).gap?'. Positions withheld.':'.'));}
 function select(id){if(!model.has(id)&&!combined?.has(id))return;stop();selected=id;clear();paint();text(node('status'),trackLabel(id)+' selected.');}
 function run(){const detail=detailCursor!==null,max=last();if(!active||(detail?detailCursor:cursor)===max)return;stop();clear();const token=generation,origin=detail?detailCursor:cursor,step=detail?.04:.2,started=root.performance?.now?.()??Date.now();timer=setInterval(()=>{if(!active||token!==generation)return;const elapsed=((root.performance?.now?.()??Date.now())-started)/1000,next=Math.min(max,origin+Math.floor((elapsed+1e-7)/step));if(next!==(detail?detailCursor:cursor)){if(detail)detailCursor=next;else cursor=next;paint();}if(next===max){stop();text(node('status'),detail?(combined?'End of reviewed combined passage · source ':'End of reviewed ball detail · source ')+format(current().time)+'. Back to passage returns to 5 Hz.':'End of this bounded passage.');}},detail?20:40);text(node('play'),'Ⅱ Pause');node('play').setAttribute('aria-pressed','true');text(node('status'),detail?(combined?'Playing players and ball at 1× in exact 0.04-second native frames. Independent gaps stay empty.':'Playing ball detail at 1× in exact 0.04-second native frames. People hidden.'):'Playing at 1× in exact 0.2-second video samples. Gaps stay empty.');}
 function enterDetail(){if(!native)return;stop();detailCursor=0;clear();paint();run();node('play').focus({preventScroll:true});}
 function back(){if(detailCursor===null)return;const previous=current().time;stop();detailCursor=null;cursor=model.index((previous-model.start)/model.step);clear();paint();text(node('status'),'Paused in 5 Hz passage at source '+format(current().time)+' · snapped to nearest passage sample from '+format(previous)+'.');node('ball-detail').focus({preventScroll:true});}
 function ask(q){if(!String(q).trim())return;stop();const t=current().time;if(detailCursor!==null&&combined){const a=combined.answer(t,selected,q),stamp='VIDEO '+format(t)+' · '+trackLabel(selected);node('thread').insertAdjacentHTML('beforeend',root.MatchWorkspace.message(q,true,stamp,'')+root.MatchWorkspace.message(a.text,false,stamp,'Estimated combined passage · local answer'));text(node('answer-status'),'Answer at source '+format(t)+' · '+trackLabel(selected)+'.');return;}const detail=detailCursor!==null,k=String(q).toLowerCase().replace(/[^a-z0-9 ]/g,' ').trim().replace(/\s+/g,' '),base=detail?{...model.answer(NaN,selected,q),text:k==='where is this track'?'Person positions are hidden throughout 25 Hz ball detail. Back to passage restores exact 5 Hz person observations; no older person location is carried here.':k==='what is visible here'?'People are hidden in ball detail.':k==='why is there a gap'?'This bounded ball segment has reviewed estimates at all 55 native frames, including one separate manual augmentation. No positions are filled outside its bounds.':k==='what supports this'?'Ball detail uses 55 reviewed native source frames, each with its own qualified camera estimate. People are hidden rather than held between their 5 Hz observations.':model.answer(NaN,selected,q).text}:model.answer(t,selected,q),extra=ball?.answer(t,q),a=extra?(extra.kind==='ball'?extra:{...extra,text:base.text.replace('Team, role and ball position are unknown.','Team and role are unknown.').replace(' Ball position is also unknown.','')+' '+extra.text}):base,stamp='VIDEO '+format(t)+' · '+(detail?'Ball detail · People hidden':trackLabel(selected));node('thread').insertAdjacentHTML('beforeend',root.MatchWorkspace.message(q,true,stamp,'')+root.MatchWorkspace.message(a.text,false,stamp,'Estimated sampled passage · local answer'));text(node('answer-status'),'Answer at source '+format(t)+(detail?' · Ball detail.':' · '+trackLabel(selected)+'.'));}
 node('range').addEventListener('input',e=>seek(Number(e.target.value)));node('composer').addEventListener('submit',e=>{e.preventDefault();ask(node('draft').value);node('draft').value='';});
 panel.addEventListener('click',e=>{const b=e.target.closest('button');if(!b)return;if(b.dataset.passageTrack)select(b.dataset.passageTrack);else if(b.dataset.passageQuestion)ask(b.dataset.passageQuestion);else if(b.id==='pl-p-play'){if(timer!==null)stop();else run();}else if(b.id==='pl-p-start')seek(0);else if(b.id==='pl-p-previous')seek((detailCursor===null?cursor:detailCursor)-1);else if(b.id==='pl-p-next')seek((detailCursor===null?cursor:detailCursor)+1);else if(b.id==='pl-p-end')seek(last());else if(b.id==='pl-p-ball-detail')enterDetail();else if(b.id==='pl-p-back-passage')back();else if(b.id==='pl-p-next-ball'&&detailCursor!==null&&combined){seek(combined.nextBall(detailCursor));}else if(b.id==='pl-p-next-ball'&&ball&&detailCursor===null){const previous=current().time,next=ball.next(previous);if(next!==null){seek((next-model.start)/model.step);text(node('status'),(next<=previous?'Wrapped to first':'Paused at next')+' ball estimate · source '+format(next)+'.');}}else if(b.id==='pl-p-gap'){const next=detailCursor!==null&&combined?combined.gap(detailCursor):detailCursor===null?model.gap(cursor):-1;if(next>=0)seek(next);}});
 function deactivate(){active=false;stop();clear();}function activate(){active=true;stop();clear();paint();}
 paint();return {activate,deactivate,stop:()=>{stop();clear();}};
}
root.PLPassageView={mount};
})(window);
